#. copy/lead
#: src/js/course-registration.js:22
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Search 35 courses across seven schools. Check prerequisites, available "
"places, and timetable clashes before enrolling. The recommended load is "
"eighteen credits."
msgstr "七学部35科目から選べます。前提科目、空席、時間の重複を確認して履修登録してください。推奨履修量は18単位です。"

