#. copy/overloadWarning
#: src/js/course-registration.js:22
msgctxt "tree:copy#/overloadWarning"
msgid ""
"Your timetable has entered danmaku density. The registrar recommends sleep "
"but will not block registration."
msgstr "時間割は弾幕密度域です。教務課は睡眠を勧めますが履修を止めません。"

#. copy/overloadToast
#: src/js/course-registration.js:22
msgctxt "tree:copy#/overloadToast"
msgid ""
"Added. Your load is above the suggestion; registration succeeded, sleep is "
"not guaranteed."
msgstr "時間割へ追加しました。推奨単位超過。履修成功、睡眠は保証外です。"

#. copy/registeredToast
#: src/js/course-registration.js:22
msgctxt "tree:copy#/registeredToast"
msgid "Added to your timetable. The room remains at its registered location for now."
msgstr "時間割へ追加しました。教室は現在、登録地点にあります。"

